OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright start, before clouding
OL,6,Fover through Wednesday morning. Chance
OL,7,Fof a band of showery rain passing
OL,8,Fthrough in the afternoon, perhaps
OL,9,Fheavy with stronger winds, especially
OL,10,Fnear coasts. Cloud then breaking with
OL,11,Fsome sunshine returning and winds
OL,12,Feasing.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FIncreasingly clear night for
OL,15,Fmuch of the region. Given light winds,
OL,16,Ftemperatures will fall, with a chilly
OL,17,Fend to the night, especially in rural
OL,18,Fareas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
