OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FLargely dry and settled on
OL,6,FThursday with sunny spells developing
OL,7,Fafter a chilly start. Light winds and
OL,8,Fgood visibility are expected, making
OL,9,Ffor a pleasant autumnal day.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FMainly
OL,12,Fdry and settled on Friday but
OL,13,Fcloudier. Dry and brighter over the
OL,14,Fweekend with some sunny or clear
OL,15,Fspells. Temperatures near or rather
OL,16,Fabove normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
